      "expression": "practical",
      "outfit": "drilling_camp",
      "text": "旧报价里只有可议、二十亩和一口井，没有五年、独占和失败后怎么办。今天不落钻，水也要喝；明天落在哪里，别只让我一个人担。",
      "next": "jt_choice_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "jt_choice_01",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "jt_choice_shared_test",
          "text": "先做七日共同试钻：盐镜出钻机与工班，照骨出旧苗牌与停止权，负岳出斜钻材料；五亩营地临时使用，出水后按实际工、水、人重谈。",
          "next": "jt_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "jian_tiezhi", "stat": "trust", "delta": 2},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "jian_tiezhi_shared_test_recorded", "value": true}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "jt_choice_land_first",
          "text": "按旧报价立即确认二十亩五年使用权，先让盐镜落主钻，出水与失败责任以后再补条款。",
          "next": "jt_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "jian_tiezhi", "stat": "respect", "delta": 1},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "jian_tiezhi_land_first_requested", "value": true}
